WEBVTT

00:07:00.036 --> 00:07:03.116
It's not a reflection
of my worth or my abilities.

00:07:03.156 --> 00:07:06.996
That's his very narrow vision
on how he sees the world.

00:07:07.436 --> 00:07:08.596
So that's one thing.

00:07:08.636 --> 00:07:12.596
I probably wouldn't have internalized
so much of that and set better boundaries.

00:07:12.636 --> 00:07:15.716
I think the other thing is,
I might have just gotten up and said,

00:07:15.756 --> 00:07:17.676
"OK, if that's what you think, I'm out.

00:07:17.676 --> 00:07:20.956
I don't need to sit here for the rest
of the dinner with you," right?

00:07:20.996 --> 00:07:23.636
I subsequently did have multiple
conversations with him,

00:07:23.676 --> 00:07:25.836
to try and get him
to understand what he said.

00:07:25.876 --> 00:07:29.236
We are not as close as we used to be,
and that has a lot to do with it.

00:07:29.236 --> 00:07:30.836
And so I had to just accept